   101	## Dependencies / Assumptions
   102	
   103	- Fixed-point i32 grid (no float atomics, FP_SCALE = 2^18), the per-entry-point 7-buffer ceiling (`cell_classify` and `project` already at 7), and Tint uniformity bound the implementation.
